{"id":"597489","name":"芝士香肠吐司丁","author":"Dinaking","authorId":"12567629","desc":"","cover":"images/597489/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"吐司片","amount":"4片"}],"sub":[{"name":"芝士片","amount":"4片"},{"name":"小香肠","amount":"8个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好所有食材。","img":"images/597489/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"土司去掉边缘部分。","img":"images/597489/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"用擀面杖把土司擀开擀薄。","img":"images/597489/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"把土司片切成对半，芝士片也切成对半并铺在土司上。","img":"images/597489/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入小香肠，末端抹上鸡蛋液。","img":"images/597489/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"全部按前面的方法卷起来。","img":"images/597489/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入鸡蛋液中，使其完全裹上鸡蛋液。","img":"images/597489/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅内加入一块黄油或者玉米油。","img":"images/597489/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"把土司卷放入锅内煎。","img":"images/597489/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"煎至四面金黄即可。","img":"images/597489/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"出锅摆盘啦。","img":"images/597489/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"色泽诱人。","img":"images/597489/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"美味可口。","img":"images/597489/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"一口一个好好吃哦。","img":"images/597489/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}